{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>銅鑼灣有人猝死。昨日（11日）晚上10時許，一名47歲羅姓女子在禮頓道52號禮智大廈住所暈倒，其62歲男友見狀報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，羅女昏迷被送往律敦治醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。女事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，女事主有身體病紀錄。</p><figure><img alt=\"女事主昏迷被送往律敦治醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197370307728379904432968.jpeg/d62fV8tLJktkcjpH50BAqJv9G04QAPOcpckFp5_JBac\"/><figcaption>女事主昏迷被送往律敦治醫院進行搶救，其後被證實死亡。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:47:18.875399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T18:21:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:31.466841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:40:54.436887+00:00","content_hash":"43874be3e5ac120d4e6955fd2efac364e4d6d8edc0aa923918f4aed0ac116952","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}